{"id":"17f36cae84cb8ff3","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-creative-mcomplete.md","title":"Myhill 创造集合完全性","display":"thm-creative-mcomplete — Myhill 创造集合完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-creative-mcomplete","aliases":["20-thm-creative-mcomplete"],"display":"thm-creative-mcomplete — Myhill 创造集合完全性","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorems 2.4.5–2.4.6；Corollary 2.4.8","source_pdf_pages":[75,76],"source_printed_pages":[39,40],"depends_on":["[[20-df-creative]]","[[20-df-mcomplete]]","[[20-thm-productive-characterization]]","[[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-creative-mcomplete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-creative-mcomplete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-creative-mcomplete — Myhill 创造集合完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorems 2.4.5–2.4.6；Corollary 2.4.8"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span><span>40</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f98c8cce12228b4a\" href=\"?note=f98c8cce12228b4a\" title=\"20-df-creative\">20-df-creative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"15cacf231068cc2e\" href=\"?note=15cacf231068cc2e\" title=\"20-df-mcomplete\">20-df-mcomplete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"141324e7d302145d\" href=\"?note=141324e7d302145d\" title=\"20-thm-productive-characterization\">20-thm-productive-characterization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" href=\"?note=50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" title=\"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism\">20-thm-myhill-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f98c8cce12228b4a\" href=\"?note=f98c8cce12228b4a\" title=\"20-df-creative\">20-df-creative</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"15cacf231068cc2e\" href=\"?note=15cacf231068cc2e\" title=\"20-df-mcomplete\">20-df-mcomplete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"141324e7d302145d\" href=\"?note=141324e7d302145d\" title=\"20-thm-productive-characterization\">20-thm-productive-characterization</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" href=\"?note=50ca9db6cf8f4a12\" title=\"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism\">20-thm-myhill-isomorphism</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}creative\\text{-}mcomplete}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Creative}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{mComplete}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}creative\\text{-}mcomplete}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Creative}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{mComplete}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 A 创造，则 A 为 c.e. 且补集生产。productive-characterization 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline K\\le_1\\overline A\">\\(\\overline K\\le_1\\overline A\\)</span>，同一见证取否定得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_1A\">\\(K\\le_1A\\)</span>。每个 c.e. B 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_1K\">\\(B\\le_1K\\)</span>，所以 A 为 1 完全，特别是 m 完全。反向若 A 为 m 完全，它已为 c.e. 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_mA\">\\(K\\le_mA\\)</span>；取补得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline K\\le_m\\overline A\">\\(\\overline K\\le_m\\overline A\\)</span>，刻画定理给补集生产。另有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_1K\">\\(A\\le_1K\\)</span>，结合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_1A\">\\(K\\le_1A\\)</span> 与 Myhill 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cong_cK\">\\(A\\cong_cK\\)</span>。这说明本原子的原有等价式以及原书更强同构结论，不依赖未展开的生产函数总化。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorems 2.4.5–2.4.6；Corollary 2.4.8；印刷页 39, 40；PDF 第 75, 76 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-creative","status":"resolved","id":"f98c8cce12228b4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-creative]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mcomplete","status":"resolved","id":"15cacf231068cc2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mcomplete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-productive-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"141324e7d302145d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-productive-characterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"50ca9db6cf8f4a12","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_o